  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Trigonometry III: stretches of sine and cosine waves</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.5: Give the two stretch factors that map y = sin x or y = cos x onto y = a sin bx or y = a cos bx, and the image of a point.</p><p id="edition">Core</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from B5 and the key points of Section B of Chapter 7 of Cassell, D., Instone, S., Ling, J., Scruton, P., Shilton, S. and West, H., SMP AS/A2 Mathematics: Core 2 for AQA, Cambridge University Press, 2004: stretch factors in the language of one-way stretches with an invariant axis, the image of a point added, randomised over a curated list.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
